<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Accendio -Japanese version-</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">IVE</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Be Alright</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5l2XppGInufS9ScfiPzkR3</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:06.220" end="00:07.930">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.930" end="00:11.330">Dear priest 打ち明けたいの</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.330" end="00:14.790">血雫と tears ただ演じるの</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.790" end="00:18.280">密やかな告白 綺麗だけど born bad</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.280" end="00:21.280">推測は no way, you just talk too much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.280" end="00:25.460">Oh 綺麗でも不気味でしょ</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.460" end="00:28.000">強かな印象が良い</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.000" end="00:32.330">Oh 優しいけど氷のよう</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.330" end="00:34.940">Gonna make you crazy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.940" end="00:39.870">Ooh 静かな心臓が</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.870" end="00:42.890">一目で yeah, I like that 止まるかも</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.890" end="00:46.880">Now I'm changing, can't you see?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.880" end="00:48.900" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Five, six, seven, eight)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.900" end="00:50.490">Watch me, don't touch me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.490" end="00:52.270">Love me, don't hurt me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.270" end="00:53.770">Watch me, don't touch me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.540" end="00:55.790">唱えて accendio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.790" end="00:57.490">Watch me, don't touch me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.490" end="00:59.130">Love me, don't hurt me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.130" end="01:00.630">Watch me, don't touch me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.400" end="01:02.060">唱えて accendio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.060" end="01:07.290" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.290" end="01:09.080">(Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah) 指先で accendio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.080" end="01:12.290" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.290" end="01:17.740">(Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah) 指先で accendio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.740" end="01:20.100">Oh 絶壁で turn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.100" end="01:23.810">初めての色で染まる瞳孔</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.810" end="01:27.300">感情は pure 眼差しは love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.300" end="01:31.010">容易くないはず out of control</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.010" end="01:34.430">香りで満たす迷路 煙の中 君を</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.430" end="01:37.600">6滴の magic syrup, and we pop into the mirror</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.600" end="01:41.240">全身にまとった pearl 2本の指で swirl</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.240" end="01:45.260">見せて 甘い curse, let them B-U-R-N (yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.260" end="01:50.100">Ooh 静かな心臓が</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.100" end="01:53.130">一目で yeah, I like that 止まるかも</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.130" end="01:57.130">Now I'm changing, can't you see?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.130" end="01:59.350" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Five, six, seven, eight)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.350" end="02:01.030">Watch me, don't touch me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.030" end="02:02.770">Love me, don't hurt me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.770" end="02:04.270">Watch me, don't touch me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.000" end="02:06.300">唱えて accendio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.300" end="02:07.950">Watch me, don't touch me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.950" end="02:09.590">Love me, don't hurt me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.590" end="02:11.090">Watch me, don't touch me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.990" end="02:12.750">唱えて accendio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.750" end="02:16.040" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.040" end="02:19.440">(Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah) 指先で accendio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.440" end="02:22.950" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.950" end="02:30.950">(Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah) 指先で accendio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.350" end="02:39.350" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(指先で accendio)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.490" end="02:42.150">Watch me, don't touch me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.150" end="02:43.810">Love me, don't hurt me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:43.810" end="02:45.310">Watch me, don't touch me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:45.170" end="02:47.320">唱えて accendio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.320" end="02:49.030">Watch me, don't touch me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.030" end="02:50.740">Love me, don't hurt me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.740" end="02:52.240">Watch me, don't touch me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:52.060" end="02:53.780">唱えて accendio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.780" end="02:57.300" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.300" end="03:00.780">(Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah) 指先で accendio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.780" end="03:04.220" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah, ah-ah, ah-ah-ah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:04.220" end="03:07.320">(Ah-ah, ah-ah-ah) 指先で accendio</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.320" end="03:11.320" /></div></body></tt>